[00:00.00] 作词 : Bic Runga
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Bic Runga
[00:10.81] So I'm listening for the weather (于是我听着天气预报)
[00:13.55]
[00:14.08] To predict the coming day (对未来日子天气的预测)
[00:15.94]
[00:16.50] Leave all thought of expectation (将所有期待都放在天气预报)
[00:19.45] To the weather man (的那个主持人身上)
[00:21.03]
[00:22.53] No it doesn't really matter (不对 他要说什么)
[00:24.65]
[00:25.38] What it is he has to say (其实并不重要啊)
[00:27.24]
[00:27.84] 'Cause tomorrows keep on blowing (因为往复的明日)
[00:30.67] In from somewhere (总是会不断降临)
[00:32.73]
[00:33.38] All the people that I know (那些我所认识的)
[00:35.81]
[00:36.32] In the apartments down below (住在楼下公寓的人们)
[00:38.55]
[00:39.20] Busy with their starring roles (全都陷在自己主演的)
[00:42.08] In their own tragedies (悲剧中 无法抽身)
[00:43.41]
[00:45.51] Sunlight sends you on your way (阳光会送你上路)
[00:48.85]
[00:50.20] And those restless thoughts (那些令你不安的念头)
[00:51.82] That cling to yesterday (将停留在昨天)
[00:54.01]
[00:55.03] Never be afraid of change (别对改变感到恐惧)
[00:58.37]
[00:59.64] I'll call you on the phone (我会给你打电话)
[01:01.84] I hate to leave you on your own (不想让你独自一人)
[01:04.16]
[01:05.00] But I'm coming home today (而我今天要回家了)
[01:08.57]
[01:10.49] And this busy inner city (这个忙忙碌碌的中心城市)
[01:12.92]
[01:13.56] Has got nothing much to say (实在没什么好说的)
[01:15.55]
[01:16.09] And I know how much (但我知道你有多次)
[01:17.87] You're hanging round the letterbox (徘徊在信箱周围)
[01:20.57]
[01:22.05] And I'm sure that as I'm writing (我能肯定当我写信时)
[01:24.21]
[01:24.87] You'll be somewhere on your way (你就在你路上的某处)
[01:27.38] In a supermarket checkout (也许是在超市的收银台)
[01:30.41] Or the restaurant (或是在饭店里)
[01:32.03]
[01:33.06] I've been doing what I'm told (我一直做着我该去做的事)
[01:35.92] I've been busy growing old (我一直都忙于长大)
[01:38.17]
[01:38.71] And the days are getting cold (天气是越来越冷了)
[01:41.58] But that's alright with me (但这对于我来说还好)
[01:43.21]
[01:44.94] Sunlight sends you on your way (阳光会送你上路)
[01:48.22]
[01:49.44] And those restless thoughts (那些令你不安的念头)
[01:51.31] That cling to yesterday (将停留在昨天)
[01:54.28] Never be afraid of change (别对改变感到恐惧)
[01:57.54]
[01:59.08] I'll call you on the phone (我会给你打电话)
[02:01.22] I hate to leave you on your own (不想让你独自一人)
[02:03.63]
[02:04.56] But I'm coming home today (而我今天要回家了)
[02:07.76]
